{"type":"message","id":"844da2db","parentId":"4d4f2397","timestamp":"2026-03-21T02:14:05.750Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户希望我配置Tavily搜索。让我再尝试一下不同的方法来配置Exa MCP服务器。\n\n根据Exa Skill的文档，MCP服务器应该可以通过gateway配置。让我尝试直接编辑配置文件来添加mcpServers配置。\n\n但是之前的尝试显示config.patch不支持mcpServers键。让我尝试另一种方法：直接编辑openclaw.json文件。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"好的，让我尝试通过直接编辑配置文件来配置Tavily（Exa）MCP服务器："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"read:77","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\LWS\\.openclaw\\openclaw.json","limit":50}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"kimi-k2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774059230239}}
