{"type":"message","id":"20c13d9d","parentId":"73026803","timestamp":"2026-03-21T02:29:24.993Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户重启了OpenClaw，想检查Tavily搜索的状态。让我先尝试使用web_search工具看看是否可用，或者检查配置是否有变化。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"好的，让我检查一下Tavily搜索的当前状态："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"web_search:80","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"小米扫地机器人6max 价格 京东 淘宝 拼多多","count":5}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"gateway:81","name":"gateway","arguments":{"action":"config.get"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"kimi-k2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774060153569}}
