              | when user mentions cloud space, folders, drive.   |                    |\n| ✓ ready   | 📦 feishu-perm                  | Feishu permission management for documents and    | openclaw-extra     |\n|           |                                 | files. Activate when user mentions sharing,       |                    |\n|           |                                 | permissions, collaborators.                       |                    |\n| ✓ ready   | 📦 feishu-wiki                  | Feishu knowledge base navigation. Activate when   | openclaw-extra     |\n|           |                                 | user mentions knowledge base, wiki, or wiki       |                    |\n|           |                                 | links.                                            |                    |\n| ✗ missing | 🔐 1password                    | Set up and use 1Password CLI (op). Use when       | openclaw-bundled   |\n|           |                                 | installing the CLI, enabling desktop app          |                    |\n|           |                                 | integration, signing in (single or multi-         |                    |\n|           |                                 | account), or reading/injecting/running secrets    |                    |\n|           |                                 | via op.                                           |                    |\n| ✗ missing | 📝 apple-notes                  | Manage Apple Notes via the `memo` CLI on macOS    | openclaw-bundled   |\n|           |                                 | (create, view, edit, delete, search, move, and    |                    |\n|           |                                 | export notes). Use when a user asks OpenClaw to   |                    |\n|           |                                 | add a note, list notes, search notes, or manage   |                    |\n|           |                                 | note folders.                       